        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "fac_lang_ya_sect"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Three of the five are rank six, and Successive Years is named among them beside Yesterday and Ten Days, while the other two are rank seven.",
        "chapters": [
          1751
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_ten_days_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The three rank six Gu are described as just passable and, at most, supplementary Immortal Gu.",
